    internal const string Help = "Select a source in Diagnostics and start the connection test. Each step shows its result; a failed step gives a remedy and dependent steps are skipped. Cancel stops the test. Home Assistant uses the entered address and token for a separate WebSocket greeting and authentication test without saving credentials or changing the running source; it does not query entities or call services. Other sources inspect current connection and freshness information. Serial testing checks the applied port selection, port discovery and an already open connection; it never opens the port, identifies the device, sends protocol commands or enables fans. A detected port alone does not confirm hardware identity or access permissions. Media metadata and audio are checked separately; start playback for audio checks. Unsupported platform sources are absent. Results are a timestamped snapshot and do not update automatically. Source settings opens the related view. Credentials, URLs and server error texts are excluded from the results.";
